**Mycorrhiza Wiki 1.16.1** is the fourteenth release of the engine, released on 2026-11-25, a little bit more than 2 weeks after [[../1.16.0 | version 1.16.0]]. This is a security release. Everyone running a public instance is advised to upgrade.

=> https://github.com/bouncepaw/mycorrhiza/releases/tag/v1.16.1 | On GitHub (including builds)

= Changes
* Fixed critical security bugs, including:
** Git RCE through careful hypha renaming
** Hardened CSP for `/binary` endpoint
** Fixed interwiki being editable by non-admins
* Fixed a Git deadlock
* **Dropped Telegram login support.** There were numerous security issues with the implementation. This was an experimental unmaintained feature, and we long considered to get rid of it, so we did.
* **Dropped Russian translation.** This was done to aid the template refactoring, which went well. We want to return it in some form in the future.
* Go version bumped to 1.27.4.

= Developers
* [[https://bouncepaw.com | Timur Ismagilov]] fixed issues per the audit and refactored.
* [[https://github.com/iljasrb | iljasrb]] did the security audit. 

Thank you very much!
